==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*20 [[Li'l Bore]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*12 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ritual Drum Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Gold Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Not a very difficult stage, simply bring some ranged attackers and/or rushers to easily clear the stage, though the [[Gold Hippoe|Sir Hippoes]] are fairly tanky, so it may take a bit of time to clear.

